{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2017b-k2.q17.material.recovered", "text": "《认识电子邮件》是七年级（上册）第五课的教学内容。本课的知识点主要有：电子邮件的特点、电子邮件的地址格式、收发电子邮件的方法，以及电子邮件的工作过程。教材中对电子邮件工作过程的描述如图16所示。 教学对象：通过调查得知，该班学生多数拥有一个电子邮箱，有使用电子邮箱收发电子邮件的经历。具有一定的逻辑思维能力，但以形象思维能力为主，对于抽象的理论知识不容易理解。 教学环境：多媒体教室。 教学用时：1课时（45分钟）。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "766a833db198d04e64bfc79b0f419f2b23e81e4f7f1d51764102016c3905d1ee", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2809, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3017, "next_source_question_number": 21, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 17, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "766a833db198d04e64bfc79b0f419f2b23e81e4f7f1d51764102016c3905d1ee"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2017b-k2.q17"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s3.k04", "ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.315.r016", "ntce.outline.315.r017", "ntce.outline.315.r018", "ntce.outline.315.r022", "ntce.outline.315.r032", "ntce.outline.315.r036"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.xinxi.2017b-k2.q17"], "word_count": 208, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "xinxi", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "766a833db198d04e64bfc79b0f419f2b23e81e4f7f1d51764102016c3905d1ee", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2809, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3017, "next_source_question_number": 21, "alignment_status": "unique_task_exc